<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Written by melt 7.42 (`melt timewarp:2:SRC in=0 out=9 SRC in=20 out=29 -consumer xml:`, SRC
     the 30 fps steps clip) from this directory, as Kdenlive writes a speed change; root and
     meta.* properties removed so the resource resolves next to this file. melt renders 20 frames:
     source 0-18 by twos, then 20-29, and its sound follows the picture frame for frame (each 2x
     frame plays source 2k then 2k + 1) at -3 dB, its mono to stereo upmix. -->
